/-!
# The high-resolution environment of the `μ > 0` passing guiding-centre torus family certificate

The variable polynomials `PHM i` (three variables: `θ`-, `ψ`-modes and the Chebyshev variable
`w`), their degree boxes (`boxHM`), static `ℓ¹` bounds (`l1HM`) and Kronecker images (`kronHM`);
the family centres `xHM c i` at the parameter `w = c`; the norm bounds `BHM i` of the centres and
the radii `EHM i` of the balls (supplied by the oracle, checked in
`Design/RationalStellaratorGCMu3CheckH*`).
Generated by `scripts/gc_kam/lam_emit_lean.py`.

Pitch cell `λ ∈ [1/8, 3/16]`: modules `RationalStellaratorGCMu3*`,
namespace `PlasmaLean.Design.RationalStellaratorGC.Mu3`; generated by
`scripts/gc_kam/lamcell` from the pipeline of the cell `[0, 1/16]`.
-/

@[expose] public section
noncomputable section

set_option linter.style.longLine false

namespace PlasmaLean.Design.RationalStellaratorGC.Mu3

open Polynomial PlasmaLean.Certificates.Kron2 PlasmaLean.Certificates.KronExpr
